# Database / Prisma

- Schema and migrations live only in `packages/database`
- No raw SQL in services — use Prisma + repositories
- Export domain access via repository classes; register via DI in Nest modules
- Migrations are additive; never weaken schema to match incomplete app code
- After schema changes: `npm run db:generate` and add/adjust repository tests
- Docs: `docs/DATA_MODEL.md`, `docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md`
